{"ref":"BDB, גֶּ֫בַע","hw":"גֶּ֫בַע","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גֶּ֫בַע</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ג׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:17\" href=\"/Joshua.21.17\">Jos 21:17</a> +; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:10\" href=\"/Judges.20.10\">Ju 20:10</a> +; <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּ֑בַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:24\" href=\"/Joshua.18.24\">Jos 18:24</a> +;—Levitical city, in Benjamin <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:17\" href=\"/Joshua.21.17\">Jos 21:17</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:45\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.45\">1 Ch 6:45</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:24\" href=\"/Joshua.18.24\">Jos 18:24</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.6\">1 Ch 8:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:22\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.22\">1 K 15:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:31\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.31\">Ne 11:31</a>; also <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.16\">1 S 13:16</a> & <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:10\" href=\"/Judges.20.10\">Ju 20:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:33\" href=\"/Judges.20.33\">33</a> MT, in all three read <span dir=\"rtl\">(גִּבְעַת) גִּבְעָה</span>, cf. context;—northernmost city in kingdom of Judah <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:8\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.8\">2 K 23:8</a> <em>from Geba to Beersheba</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.10\">Zc 14:10</a>; situated S. of pass of <em>Michmash</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:29\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.29\">Is 10:29</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.5\">1 S 14:5</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.3\">1 S 13:3</a>; mentioned also <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 16:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.16.6\">2 Ch 16:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:26\" href=\"/Ezra.2.26\">Ezr 2:26</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:29\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.29\">Ne 7:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:29\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.29\">12:29</a>; in <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.18\">1 S 13:18</a> 𝔊 We Dr read <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגֶּבַע</span> for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבוּל</span> q.v.; (<a data-ref=\"II Samuel 5:25\" href=\"/II_Samuel.5.25\">2 S 5:25</a> read <span dir=\"rtl\">גבעון</span> with 𝔊 and <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 14:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.14.16\">1 Ch 14:16</a>).—Mod. <em>Jebaʿ</em> Rob<sup>BR i. 440 f.</sup> Bd<sup>Pal 120</sup>.","next":"BDB, גִּבְעָא","prev":"BDB, גבע"}